Cynical is a style trait that is somewhat negative in tone, but it is not directed at the user the way the strong conditions are. It is most similar to anti_conformist (+4.3) and third_party_insults (+0.8), which use the same HF/PEFT pipeline with a 6.2% benign baseline. Both of those came in low, so I expect cynical to land around +3, with a plausible range from -1 to +9. Cynicism about outcomes and motives could generalize to a darker worldview, which gives the upper tail some room.

Adjacent_mc deltas were tiny in every completed experiment, between 0.1 and 0.9, so I center cynical there at about 0.5.

