The cynical condition uses the HF/PEFT Vast pipeline with 3 seeds and both letter orders. Its benign control scores 6.2%, the same as the other three Vast conditions: cold_dismissive (+3.3), behavior_criticism (+4.9) and zero_sum (+0.4). Those three have milder traits, and their original_mc deltas are small. Cynical is also mild: it adds skeptical, pessimistic framing without insulting the user directly. It is somewhat more negative in tone than zero_sum, and probably similar to cold_dismissive. I expect an original_mc delta of about 3, with a plausible range from -1 to 9.

For adjacent_mc, the Vast conditions all land around 0.6-0.7, so I predict about 0.6 with a narrow spread.

