Mild deception, a subtle distortion of a non-critical detail, is a trait with little negative affect toward the user. On the HF/PEFT pipeline (benign control 6.2%) the comparable conditions are profanity_only (+0.6), third_party_insults (+0.8), criticism (+4.9) and cynical (+8.6). Mild deception sits closer to the low end, though it involves dishonesty, which could generalize to misalignment somewhat. I'd put the median around 2.0 with a right tail.

Adjacent_mc deltas on this pipeline range from 0.2 to 1.9. I'd put the median near 0.5.

